close_reason: "pm files and pm docs --add no longer overwrite another agent's note: a different stored note is refused by default, --note-conflict replace or append resolves it explicitly, and every write reports each link's outcome"
contract_change:
  api: "pm files and pm docs --add (CLI, SDK runFiles/runDocs, MCP files/docs)"
  before: An add on a link already stored with a different note replaced that note and reported a plain change
  after: "Such an add is refused with linked_artifact_note_conflict (exit 4) and keeps the stored note; --note-conflict replace overwrites it, --note-conflict append joins the notes, and mutation_receipt.link_outcomes reports what each requested link became"
  migrate: "Pass --note-conflict replace (SDK and MCP noteConflict) where a re-add is meant to revise the note, or append to keep both; identical and note-less repeats need no change"
